WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.141
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Online Class!

2
00:00:05.441 --> 00:00:07.919
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:08.219 --> 00:00:10.721
Unit nine. Too and Enough

4
00:00:11.717 --> 00:00:16.761
Let's learn eight new words. Listen, then it's your turn to say it!

5
00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.053
Too hot!

6
00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.118
Too hot. Your turn!

7
00:00:25.018 --> 00:00:26.286
Too hot!

8
00:00:26.586 --> 00:00:27.471
Great!

9
00:00:28.483 --> 00:00:29.450
Too heavy!

10
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:32.491
Too heavy. Your turn!

11
00:00:35.391 --> 00:00:36.497
Too heavy!

12
00:00:36.797 --> 00:00:37.925
Super!

13
00:00:38.917 --> 00:00:40.150
Too expensive!

14
00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.342
Too expensive. Your turn!

15
00:00:46.242 --> 00:00:47.464
Too expensive!

16
00:00:47.764 --> 00:00:48.707
Well done!

17
00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:50.904
Too noisy!

18
00:00:51.804 --> 00:00:54.305
Too noisy. Your turn!

19
00:00:57.205 --> 00:00:58.543
Too noisy!

20
00:00:58.843 --> 00:00:59.554
Yes!

21
00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:01.725
Too far!

22
00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:04.860
Too far. Your turn!

23
00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:09.051
Too far!

24
00:01:09.351 --> 00:01:10.282
Good job!

25
00:01:11.283 --> 00:01:12.250
Old enough!

26
00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:14.908
Old enough. Your turn!

27
00:01:17.808 --> 00:01:18.774
Old enough!

28
00:01:19.074 --> 00:01:20.099
Wonderful!

29
00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:22.270
Tall enough!

30
00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:25.474
Tall enough. Your turn!

31
00:01:28.374 --> 00:01:29.619
Tall enough!

32
00:01:29.919 --> 00:01:30.955
Nice!

33
00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:33.276
Strong enough!

34
00:01:34.176 --> 00:01:36.445
Strong enough. Your turn!

35
00:01:39.345 --> 00:01:40.869
Strong enough!

36
00:01:41.169 --> 00:01:42.205
Excellent!

37
00:01:43.217 --> 00:01:51.122
Too hot, Too hot! Too heavy, Too heavy! Too expensive, Too expensive! Too noisy, Too noisy!

38
00:01:51.422 --> 00:01:59.699
Too far, Too far! Old enough, Old enough! Tall enough, Tall enough! Strong enough, Strong enough!

39
00:01:59.999 --> 00:02:02.187
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:03.183 --> 00:02:24.860
Malis wants to do many things. The soup is too hot to eat now. The box is too heavy for her, but Dad is strong enough to carry it. The new phone is too expensive. The market is too noisy, and the beach is too far to walk. Is Malis tall enough for the big ride? Yes! Is she old enough to drive? Not yet!

41
00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.391
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:28.383 --> 00:02:30.629
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:33.529 --> 00:02:36.333
Strong enough! Well done!

44
00:02:37.317 --> 00:02:39.888
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:42.788 --> 00:02:45.243
Too expensive! Well done!

46
00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.600
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.851
Too far! Well done!

48
00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.281
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:56.581 --> 00:02:59.697
It's too heavy. She isn't old enough.

50
00:03:00.497 --> 00:03:01.510
Your turn!

51
00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:07.906
It's too heavy. She isn't old enough.

52
00:03:08.917 --> 00:03:11.323
Are you tall enough to ride a big bike?

53
00:03:14.623 --> 00:03:15.949
It's too heavy.

54
00:03:16.249 --> 00:03:17.447
Great answer!

55
00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:22.507
Today's value is patience. Wait calmly and take your time.

56
00:03:22.807 --> 00:03:24.667
I will try, Ms. Lily!

57
00:03:25.683 --> 00:03:30.823
Great job today, everyone! See you in Unit ten. Bye-bye!

58
00:03:31.123 --> 00:03:32.275
Bye-bye!

